  <item>
    <title>夏天还是要和朋友一起玩啊（续）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a953b1ba0210c197dcb020d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a953b1ba0210c197dcb020d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 08:33:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三人闲聊（续）。</span></p><p><span>前半段回顾当天的逛吃活动，后半段补齐上个月在宜宾的行程。</span></p><p><span>录音时每个笑声共鸣的片段，都让我在剪辑中再笑了一遍。我在群里问他俩，会不会全世界只有我们仨自己觉得好笑？大概率是的。</span></p><p><strong><span>照片们：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>烟火指数·成都双年展 成都市美术馆</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fov64TG9WmaW_USwZl9pcLDhIbL6.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>《远游的记忆会像幽影一样一直回来》 熊小默个展</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frzxuui7A8evlcmtpK4gxsJewmmT.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>宜宾市 康大口磨面x高县土火锅</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFv5_WVq-Hum5TKvZyjrHYnYGXd.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>宜宾李庄古镇</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRWoo3RljK1JfkyiqQ1Ud4_Cp7L.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>全聚白糕（在李庄古镇后门外的街上）</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1nf_ttNlajpW5GYZP9j1_cYdWs.jpg"><p><strong><span>朋友：</span></strong><span>佳佳｜宾宾</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>卅卅</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong><span>Wild Card-Ghost (王琳凯)</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lms6H6BmRsLXdPiNF64f0qU6xWmQ.m4a" length="41739396" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:00</itunes:duration>
