  <item>
    <title>夏天还是要和朋友一起玩啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6b025456a3f3491ba76c4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6b025456a3f3491ba76c4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 07:53:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三人闲聊。</span></p><p><span>剪辑的时候发现我们有好多莫名的笑声，并没有足够幽默的上下文，但我还是把它们都保留了下来，希望不会对你的听感有太多影响。</span></p><p><span>认识近十八年，这竟然是我们仨第一次共同旅行，虽然只是在中间城市短暂的两天一夜。但就像一颗石子投入池中，这个周末的出行计划，提前好几天就令我们的互动激起超过平日的涟漪。我也是第一次，在旅行当中就开始和朋友们进行起面对面“复盘”，毕竟录音时这趟行程才开始了几个钟头。</span></p><p><span>各自视角的叙述，分享不同的心理活动，区别于线上聊天的现实体感，令我感叹，虽然大多数成年人已经不再拥有暑假，但夏天，还是要和朋友一起玩啊。</span></p><p><span>很快，下次见。</span></p><p><strong><span>朋友：</span></strong><span>佳佳｜宾宾（星星）</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>卅卅</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong><span>Restless Heart - Sun City</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lk7xzXqI9E23ephMImNb1g2ZHwB8.m4a" length="40263477" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhj70YoVwuKCgxH_1bIfTqPbjMlG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第一阶段职场生活小结</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4367682e335a35a80baedc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4367682e335a35a80baedc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 06:57:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，我是卅卅，我语速有点慢，你可以倍速收听。</span></p><p><span>充斥着大量工作的忙碌五月，人和人、人和事之间的摩擦力似乎也变强，让我很想大力吐槽一把职场生活。但当拖到六月底，那股不吐不快的情绪已经缓和。</span></p><p><span>我的二十代，算是度过了职场生活的第一阶段。于是可以像翻旧照片一样，翻翻过去这些年里，那些属于我的平凡普通又真实鲜活的职场记忆。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 和三位领导的battle</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> +2C：令我头大的随性跳跃派</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> +2B：我不要为你的情绪负责</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> +2A：真诚表达胜过完美话术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 和同事x、y的一次beef</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 和同事z的一次失败沟通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> 职场边界感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a> 分清人与人、事与事的边界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> 职场语言风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 我不喜欢的同事特质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2686">44:46</a> 我很欣赏的同事特质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a> 鸣谢我的职场伙伴</span></p><p><span>Shoutout to:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Frank的倾听鼓励，xinni的诚挚温柔。</span></p></li><li><p><span>通透练达的和羊，从容自若的青青。</span></p></li><li><p><span>还有一众鲜活、热忱、明亮的年轻同事。</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 此时此刻我的感悟</span></p><ul><li><p><span>理想的职场并不存在</span></p></li><li><p><span>目前我没有职场榜样</span></p></li><li><p><span>工作和生活需要分离</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><p><span>卅卅</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><p><span>働きたくないです - </span><strong><span>mc ニンニン</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lmYBdDJFhuqwtWKJOV2GN9e2SWb8.m4a" length="50361606" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhZjRAl3hDa9eQFCFSJe_r7nUOv.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>而且你善于捕捉细节</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f34e597de62670b71f7491</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f34e597de62670b71f7491</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 14:39:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，我是卅卅，我语速有点慢，你可以倍速收听。</span></p><p><span>今天来讲一些和人相处时我注意到的小细节。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 听到办公室里有人剪指甲我会牙痒痒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 喝水时发出咕噜咕噜的漱口声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 聚餐时直接用自己的筷子去汤里夹菜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 需要共用吸管和勺子的时候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 吃饭时我不太想听到这种话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> “我选你选剩下的那一颗”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> “那些在网上应该都能买到吧”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> “我来查一下”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> “我以为你想自己来”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> “你把水放我包里吧”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a> 一些标志性瞬间和一个决定性瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 朋友们印象中关于我的细节</span></p><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><p><span>卅卅</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><p><span>临海线-silent黑白年代</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lkR7M5gm8GUqc3Cu372R2n6lm1hu.m4a" length="33477444" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp5eaLvOKVpLFImiZpu2AyX3CVrt.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>每个月最后一天我会整理相册</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cbbf30e2c8be3155060926</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cbbf30e2c8be3155060926</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 12:41:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，我是卅卅，我语速很慢，你可以倍速收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请你陪我一起整理这个月的相册，谢谢，晚安。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 相册里最近的一张照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7l0nn-3sShXnd-FV9xkxR9w8GN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 朋友的互动消息</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslO01R3Q84Lu5_7hKjR2NZEuPcT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 关于鬼鬼祟祟拍照这件事（无图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 老房子楼下</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnIzW7X6oS2oQmeVIPw_qo89R8eo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 有愣愣鱼，没有趴趴鱼！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpKacdIdtSM0H4mBeD09hwjRr1RX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 我的插花作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfYIAb9aZ4BR41FoKMfMZD7SNEk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 盒马的红杏冰茶和我的橙色袜子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flrj0BwCcJxpH_fvcp9rpN0o-F8J.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 橡皮树和柚子花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknLd2-LYuFET6z9AnVgF-Y9XZH7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 小猫饮水</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqxmburcXiQOdlGzDPrRyKNzXZq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 青椒炒猪耳朵</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FinzzFedAPPGbZ8zjZGearC2O8Vn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> 葱香虾仁米粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLxS0FijO3uwQsMcwa-Lr_WSAiE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 不管有没有虫啊，我爱吃桑葚</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi46wan-x93N4CXPrZR0aR-93bdq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 偶遇两只小鹦鹉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk-UfICue8GImI0EkxFIHxVqtxLu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 山乘树的玉米浓汤司康</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZqxifXLmHZtIxrMvCLo8S7jMh5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 红糖很棒的红糖凉糕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7ScPKE6np-ttg3yiVDTfAxtbno.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> 《在世界尽头相遇》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEWPXFQzsR7szpNiHIf9MCB7asl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 茶颜悦色的小零食</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk5Z3drvye94CfpGN4FocZM6irlq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a> 抬头看到一棵树</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVN0r8rnF55ka16n2Tfv6NsDoT4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 低头看到一只小狗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQli8QDtmRJmuhL8oi7uqatc_xK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 招待你心目中最重要的人（无图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 让我们共战春风（无图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 星夜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtwuWwDqtB5_75gOvO5PCdDOIwnN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 小红薯聊重庆天气</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtjIfVHXHYBwwgUGlSjIXi2kw3P_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 常春油麻藤和公园眺望</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpqvCKrcLc8cEg3GsoqLx9dIRCEn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoBtrQv0we9diLoEjNMYryqThHE0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 草莓番茄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvdJQWM2cZCj2rDh0b5VdV87Vz5f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 我的粉色康乃馨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fha-aX0jeXukftOoYji1AmM-7vEC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 米林爸爸可颂的咸奶油草莓卷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbrbOUSQa80ULMBJg4HKUyM1AgR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 什么颜色的彩椒最好吃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjBDyHBtHUH_uwM3oYJkzefQlz9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> 椿笋火腿焖饭和米汤萝卜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9CBdYkpdEmA2FvflvpWDwjyT0W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> Do you remember？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFogbqvUHrNHHTLFHsfTRHmpkUg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2407">40:07</a> 下次元宵节可以尝试仙贝夹汤圆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghxtMCU8z6x7fiK3Crnc8XFvZLx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">42:33</a> 祝世界和平，人类友爱。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>卅卅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>牵挂 (滚石撞乐队2)-椅子乐团 The Chairs</span></p>]]></description>
