  <item>
    <title>我的2026县城春节假期存档</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a1b9ac66e2c30377aaa088</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a1b9ac66e2c30377aaa088</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，我是卅卅，我语速很慢，你可以倍速收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚刚过去的春节假期，我感觉还不错，想要记住它，也分享给你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你也新年开心。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 我们家一般都是怎么过年的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 小县城里的日常活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 和我妈没有任何beef的愉快假期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 在我爸眼里我可能是一只河豚吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 真正想念和必须要见的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> 留给自己一段独属时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 节前提醒&amp;节后小结</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvi3md2IcVRSrHPy4nHAIx3cOPgK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFXRKHu1T-3fsZZYxuXFMOtOzg3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtuGjCwrtHRcYAYTB8nG_srHJ9eF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpssQkmx4W79ITBMZLDD1Wnwc3OX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>卅卅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>DtMF (我应该多拍些照片)-Bad Bunny</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>图片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>01深山含笑/02打柚子/03芝芝/04啵啵</span></p>]]></description>
