  <item>
    <title>vol.30 新疆真的很大，它大到我们没有觉得很拥挤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d6aa5fb4befcf730160de5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d6aa5fb4befcf730160de5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Sep 2025 15:05:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五月中旬，我和好朋友花椒、萝卜一起聊了聊他俩刚刚结束的伊犁旅行。时隔几个月，我甚至比当时还要更沉浸在他们对这趟旅程的生动描述里。回想起来，我从未如此细节地听朋友描述过一场旅行，这令我感到一种因别样的参与带来的别样的幸福。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 花椒和萝卜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 旅行目的地，跟团或自驾，攻略和分工？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 决定了，我们去伊犁小环线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a> 连夜开车，从乌鲁木齐到赛里木湖，开启环湖顺时针</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 帆船中间，波光粼粼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmoEYelA8HBgN2vt-z7K8ztBkqH0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo36iIBkDGpp3roofOKA5x3eRpaO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 便利店邂逅挚爱牛板筋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftz1pF-ghcJSKaOapMcJZYY1gwaU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 松树头和小步舞曲、徒步旅人aka萝卜下山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-6v4ikfWaq1B2aXGgO4DvDIxNW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCDWxfVbU8OSMsJ9NCteN40p661.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKUc6pq07EjEsfWcIdlt9_DliFD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fix9_Na-R1VhG-JQZULGW1oHpg2t.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmhr48OcdFBhrx45uRyqdoLoLQeP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 伊宁六星街的美味烧烤店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiqyi-tLik1RwsoKjE1ZDDbniiQu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfnzKG0BYkJ1Axjr6Glcgzy0ZWc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 去往恰西森林公园，牛马吃草，雪山云杉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGXh-dC6ycWVAPHJvKmu3ZEJCqy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0O-41chbfyBcN-mdjfqElxssGb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhmu7OEDtM9BCvaFaEW4nUoD7gZV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXb8fWzgcHuhwDeyFfh2Ia2ikWJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlB9yrlj9tBur-0VVSkWhR-bRA5Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 库尔德宁的人生大盘鸡（特色老牌子拌面）和最好吃的酒店早餐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRzg7qcimL-6Ody-LAekDiz5rla.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 库尔德宁的雪山、云杉和草原，我们观景和徒步</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3wgrSWARlUv-UMzzOPOgIZJ_-Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flg27N6ePrcF0Rf4MogwotU1s_C_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLOd6I7vAtEYPv2XZwIPPilA7f3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDZnC0wSwrZX0l-Z0Dju2bBnlfM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkr4lgDcddaMxDmUiMMWPcb5gqtC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWYmLtDL6zE1PEW5knRTgTSX-gz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtmLuWK1uTdVbwXkv0oI3Nt9wk0O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 经过特克斯湖，野餐的人们</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg0wZT-Zaw9u1-VqKdlNK5-WiCtO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 在没有红绿灯的特克斯县城，吃椒麻鸡和裤带烤肉面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHDIUG2vk1G4pNoevRjhsDehZn-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 此行最深刻的记忆是，关于一只小猫咪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv09d0ccCpr5FOW8dMXJi12Shj4a.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPsYcL-FjgL3GubKL14j3rpqp-e.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 在琼库什台和乌孙古道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvNjqyu_4Exz7xaGwjKfJka9Jdjp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loV8Oet1h5N6xA_O0QhgU7UvkeXr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpxKnUOQZgOBNaMlmF3jzquBTlLS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo_qbqwTVwoEH61fiU_WkYir-13U.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luXYjVRQKiePuWCXLShnyDIRhzhu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 看日落、看星河</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5vYNHh1b-z9d-6d9l13y46Xmj8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8lXp56_XxbybPe5hGOx_sXI5kQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTmugYExeCko2Hj3vvx88stO05h.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftw6FP74NnAajLCVwfwxua38EOXk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 日出，去往那拉提</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlWPbhV3EEw4DW6mfZV366MAqKc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKG236dJLwz7NLJU4L_aOvxboSl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4wDXlfi9gKZ2joernLjJmBfSR_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGuYvQSyiL6oG6Br5zGV8yOjDWb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv7s73bgffpHYNUNGsrEglwzN4cH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljOd1qBsciUed1KSHkOlYyHNt0Uz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3321">55:21</a> 歹歹的巴扎创意新疆菜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0UluOI75fyfES94TgItRD05cxM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3613">60:13</a> 盘龙古道的这颗树，在小红书上挺火的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm801PP4sRfIM2R971-COdDBcT79.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3711">61:51</a> 伊宁的重庆风味烧烤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvFpsQCLrAUZs-qOlP8R_GhVHaoe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>嘉宾｜花椒、萝卜</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜卅卅</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面｜美丽赛湖</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单｜我们万岁-陈奕迅/eason and the duo band</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lvtRjNYAvPNz1zGwMwDsZwX7Tgnd.m4a" length="71101269" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQoWr_f-xpxkLTe4vatIQOrWxVH.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
