    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日常在意过的一些小事，随手录制，攒攒就发。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 今夏心情写照和典型周末画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> “不要小看基础款，比如吐司。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 上周末，我主动加班了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> “被动的人，太伤害我了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 为自己定制的阅读、收听与播放清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜卅卅</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面｜在咖啡店工作时喝的黄油啤酒冰美式</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单｜夏がそうさせた (夏天就这样)-never young beach</span></p>]]></description>
