  <item>
    <title>vol.26 记录一切想要留痕的生活内容</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e8de0f8eecdbeb60021af4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e8de0f8eecdbeb60021af4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 06:09:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>记录这件事，原来是我的兴趣所在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目的内容，是我自己想做的十年记录回顾，同样也想分享给在这件事上和我或许有相似点或许截然不同的朋友们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当疲倦于用几个简单的字母来给自己下定义，或许可以花更多时间和精力去觉察、了解和探索——我，喜欢哪些改变，适合怎样的生活。这个过程或许迂回婉转，却令我感到无比自由和丰富。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 我为什么想做记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 曾经使用过的记录工具回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a> 线下：手帐本、笔记本、月历、便签本、便利贴、软木板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 线上：Bear熊掌记、flomo浮墨笔记、滴答清单、水滴清单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 现在在用的记录型应用-手机自带组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> iPhone相簿/共享相簿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIePIhhrMteN9eKbNUd212T3Q7b.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> 备忘录、语音备忘录、日历、无边记、手记</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1jMkUrMr0t_9PnjoB5kKJsn0uJ.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 现在在用的记录型应用-下载软件组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> Pendo、Microsoft OneNote、石墨文档、微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 2024年，我如何做日常记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrrCJwtYHOUpyd5R5j506HLWpCd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 我用OneNote来记录什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm6horwW5R8X_Jsi3BSLaPhiYnwg.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> 我用Pendo来记录什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtA3r6yVjl_4BTXCVR4vPbLeqm7r.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> 使用备忘录和语音备忘录是我的生活习惯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGFbcMHJHlfFqw5DvKMwltjSRBh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">40:59</a> 我的相册运转逻辑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgs0i6-N9DorTMoSaCGvcVZLN-V4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 2025年，记录和生活都随便一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a> 抛弃线下记录工具，用日历记录日程</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnpfHPPe69yPtwzC0xdpPFg_hShf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">50:24</a> 做这些记录到底有什么意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3162">52:42</a> 分享几篇具体的记录内容</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜卅卅</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面｜手机上的笔记应用文件夹</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌单｜花-藤井風</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61b8bce227396bd6df8166ba/lvbPJtAe1XdwAsBDHlvQfdZZARUe.m4a" length="59180594" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpymMi53XOaJM8J2QeQM2tosn7u6.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
